{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Disturbing news has been circulating in all the media since this morning:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Police report a rise in aggressive group behavior, with individuals using claws and spitting unknown fluids. Incidents are spreading across neighborhoods. Authorities urge people to avoid crowds and public transport. Stay home if possible.&quot;</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will it prevent you from completing your mission? Absolutely not. Should you rethink your plan? Most likely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd0d What\u2019s Inside</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>A new kind of threat</strong>: Your enemies have been infected by a deadly virus, making them faster, more aggressive, and far more numerous. Forget stealth, these foes come straight for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Unpredictable behavior</strong>: Infected enemies won\u2019t hesitate to charge your squad head-on or spit infected blood from a distance, forcing you to adapt your tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2728\u00a0<strong>New Skins</strong>: Each faction gets new unique skins to tweak your style and dive deeper into this new universe.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2660340?t=1754065994","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660340/51c46357b4b5fa54986bd5aaa4f71034bed5826b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754065994","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660340/70c56a7399d8365eb2aa96d3b100c36ff97ec084/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754065994","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660340/70c56a7399d8365eb2aa96d3b100c36ff97ec084/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754065994","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"descripti